  "details": "After the update by Squid, that has added the \"Switch to avatar\" buttons to the website, i noticed that the titles of all avatars' pages are \"Avatar - VRChat\" instead of \"[avatar's name] - VRChat\" like before.\n\nFor example, https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_26187637-0c30-4a09-86e1-bc928c07309e should be titled \"VRRat - VRChat\" but isn't.\n\nI've already posted it in response to the announcement about it on Twitter, but that was ignored :roll: (i know it's not technically a place to post about bugs, but c'mon).",
